### Sentinel — API Examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## 1. Predictions
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get 15 ranked predictions for week 2026-03-09 (ISO date format)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2026-03-09
Accept: application/json

### Get 15 ranked predictions using ISO-8601 week format (2026-W11)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2026-W11
Accept: application/json

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## 2. Decision Evidence & Explainability
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Explain why a specific gateway was ranked where it is (canonical 12-char hex ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2026-03-09/02D3289B907C/explain
Accept: application/json

### Explain using colon-delimited MAC format (automatically normalized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2026-03-09/02:D3:28:9B:90:7C/explain
Accept: application/json

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## 3. Pairwise Comparison
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Compare two gateways to see feature-level reasons why A outranked B
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2026-03-09/02D3289B907C/compare/029E65D7B701
Accept: application/json

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## 4. Re-run (Explicit Cache Invalidation)
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Re-run ranking for week (invalidates cache and recalculates from source data)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2026-03-09/rerun
Accept: application/json

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## 5. Health, Readiness & OpenAPI Documentation
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health check (includes telemetry and master data availability)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Application info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI JSON specification
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### Swagger UI interactive documentation
# Open in browser: http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html
